# VulkanMod112 settings screen.
#
# Generated with -Dvulkanmod112.dumpLang=true (Gradle: ./gradlew runClient -PdumpLang),
# from the screen as it is actually built. Keys are derived from the English text in
# the source, so renaming an option in English orphans its translations: regenerate
# this file and diff it to catch that.
#
# A literal percent sign must be written %% — every value goes through String.format.

